    "created_at": "2020-12-30T22:19:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-12-30T22:19:25Z",
    "body": "I figured it out. `/etc/locale.conf` wasn't created so `LANG` wasn't set properly. I set it and rebooted and now things are working properly. Thanks!",
